# What `tilolang layout-check` finds in the shipped apps today, one finding id per line: these
# are known and do not fail `tests/layout_check.rs`; a finding not named here does. Take a line
# out once its problem is fixed (the test says when one no longer shows).
#
# The window's own buttons (Back, Show sidebar, More) keep their pointer size on touch.
small-hit-target notes › (window) › nav-shell-back [Button]
small-hit-target notes › (window) › nav-shell-more-overview [Button]
small-hit-target notes › (window) › nav-shell-sidebar [Button]
small-hit-target tasks › (window) › nav-shell-back [Button]
small-hit-target tasks › (window) › nav-shell-more-overview [Button]
small-hit-target tasks › (window) › nav-shell-sidebar [Button]
small-hit-target mail › (window) › nav-shell-back [Button]
small-hit-target chat › (window) › nav-shell-back [Button]
small-hit-target chat › (window) › nav-shell-sidebar [Button]

# The apps' own views.
small-hit-target tasks › task_row › row [SwipeRow]
overflow mail › conversation › std.page [Stack]
small-hit-target chat › message › std.thread_chip [Chip]
